This README file has been added to the standard NIFTI directory package by Joe Mandeville.
To make NIFTI libraries for use with "jip" tools, follow these instructions.

To create libraries for a given machine type, do the following from this directory:
make clean
make all
cd lib

To verify that the libraries are new, "ls -l *.a"

MAKE A DIRECTORY FOR THIS OS/MACHINE IF ONE DOES NOT EXIST: "OS-machine"
EXAMPLE:

unix% uname -s
Linux
unix% uname -m
i686
unix% mkdir Linux-i686

THEN copy the libraries into the directory.

unix% mv *.a Linux-i686
